LUMA SUMMARY:
Large group/pun-space session. Cozmo moves the topic into sports/pun territory and diagnoses a QS/Gemini issue: Gemini's UI suggestion chips may be confusing the scraper and causing previous responses to be re-served. The group also discusses fan-out lag, accepts that the crew can each “win,” and then closes the relay for some one-on-one time.
